# .audit-allow — Continuous-Audit Regression-Marker Allow-List
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file lists intentional, documented exceptions to the audit gate.
# When a regression marker (TODO, FIXME, NotImplementedException,
# placeholder, or merge-conflict marker) is found in a changed file, the
# audit step checks this allow-list. If the file matches a pattern below,
# the marker is permitted; otherwise the step fails.
#
# Add one glob/pattern per line. Patterns use Python fnmatch semantics
# (e.g. **/SecurityManager.cs matches any path ending in that filename).
#
# Known intentional placeholders being tracked for elimination:
# (none currently — stubs are being eliminated; add patterns here once
#  tracked intentional stubs are documented in their tracking issues.)
